s Mayoi and Sakaki making fun of her. Later, Mayoi stumbles into Io who ends up elbowing Sakaki in the face.\n\nPart B: Tsumiki hears fortune advice over the radio to take the initiative, and she goes to find Io at the station and grabs his hand and puts it on her head. The gang ends up talking about fortunes. Later, Miyama borrows Io's glasses for good luck at the vending machine, making Tsumiki blush. Miyama ends up with a lot of sodas. Finally, they flip through the a love compatibility horoscope. Io and Tsumiki get \"good compatibility\" but Io says he'd rather follow his heart than listen to his horoscope. After some prodding from Sakaki, he admits that he doesn't mind getting \"good compatibility\" with Tsumiki.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z99XU5zVRgT1IruVcQKPR4EkbY4.jpg"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:16273","mal:16273"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"16273","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"18531"},{"provider":"mal","id":"16273","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63712","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"257888","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"1"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nobW89qmqe1YClDLwBXuOzmmEqv.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt2309934/img"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/257888/clearlogo/611cfcd7ea5c8.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fPYWLGz3vDEZAjg52PBrwT47u00.jpg"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/257888-3.jpg"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt2309934/img"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx16273-FhEHi6SHzllH.png"}],"background